/* 2条新区域暗线 × 7段 = 14段（峭壁天鹅绒暗层 Velvet Mirage 7段 + 旧学园天文翼楼 Observatory Wing 7段） */

:: MP Quest Velvet Mirage 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>>
丝绒假面回廊尽头的银狐壁龛下，半枚未干的红火漆印落在波斯地毯边缘，暗门锁孔里还残留着蜂蜡碎屑。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回天鹅绒门廊 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="velvet-q-1">
<<sneakicon>><<link "用细银针挑出锁孔蜂蜡 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#velvet-q-1">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	你用银针轻轻挑出锁孔里残存的红蜡模，看清了内廊暗锁的三齿深浅。<span class="green">你摸清了假面暗门的锁芯构造。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前去镜面沙龙查探 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	银针在锁簧上打滑，崩出一声脆响，走廊尽头传来执事的脚步声。<span class="red">你被铜棱刮痛指尖，只得退回廊柱后。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "循着龙涎香气辨认去向 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#velvet-q-1">>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<span class="green">你摸清了假面暗门的锁芯构造。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前去镜面沙龙查探 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你被铜棱刮痛指尖，只得退回廊柱后。</span><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Quest Velvet Mirage 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>>
镜面试衣沙龙的第三面斜角落地铜镜背面透出微弱穿堂风，镜框右下角的鎏金玫瑰雕花似乎可以旋动。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回镜面试衣沙龙 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Salon]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="velvet-q-2">
<<investigateicon>><<link "按逆时针旋动鎏金玫瑰 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#velvet-q-2">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>>
	铜镜背后弹开一道半尺宽的夹层，里面夹着一张标注观海露台炭盆暗格的羊皮便笺。<span class="green">你取出了铜镜夹层里的密信。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺便笺去观海露台 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	玫瑰旋钮卡死在半途，镜框边缘的铜刺划破了你的手背。<span class="red">你没能打开铜镜夹层。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "对照镜面反光寻找合页 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#velvet-q-2">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>>
	<span class="green">你取出了铜镜夹层里的密信。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺便笺去观海露台 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你没能打开铜镜夹层。</span><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Quest Velvet Mirage 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>>
观海露台角落的铸铁火盆里银炭将熄，底座青石板的排水凹槽下压着一只扁平的黄铜烟盒。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回露台观海雅座 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Terrace]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="velvet-q-3">
<<investigateicon>><<link "用火钳夹出底座铜烟盒 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#velvet-q-3">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>>
	你稳稳夹出那只黄铜烟盒，盒内藏着传菜铜梯的发条钥匙与三名失踪舞者的押契编号。<span class="green">你拿到了传菜梯发条钥匙。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往后台传菜铜梯 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	火盆余烬突然爆出火星烫红了你的手腕，露台外传来侍者巡查声。<span class="red">你被火星烫伤，不得不暂避。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<fisticon>><<link "浇灭余炭徒手撬开石板 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#velvet-q-3">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11600 or ($willpower or 0) gte 440>>
	<span class="green">你拿到了传菜梯发条钥匙。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往后台传菜铜梯 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你被火星烫伤，不得不暂避。</span><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Quest Velvet Mirage 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>>
拍卖暗厅东侧丝绒挂帷后的黄铜传菜梯停在半层，梯厢底板下卡着一只上了双簧锁的红木押契匣。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回私人拍卖暗厅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="velvet-q-4">
<<sneakicon>><<link "用发条钥匙打开双簧锁 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#velvet-q-4">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 270 or ($science or 0) gte 260>>
	双簧锁应声弹开，红木匣里整齐码着二楼包厢今晚私下交割的贵宾底单。<span class="green">你查获了暗层私下交割底单。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[潜上二楼金纱包厢 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	传菜梯滑轮猛地往下沉了半尺，铁缆擦破你的手掌，发出沉闷撞击声。<span class="red">滑轮异响惊动了楼下护卫。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<fisticon>><<link "拉住配重缆绳稳住梯厢 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#velvet-q-4">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11700 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260>>
	<span class="green">你查获了暗层私下交割底单。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[潜上二楼金纱包厢 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">滑轮异响惊动了楼下护卫。</span><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Quest Velvet Mirage 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>>
二楼贵宾包厢的双层金线纱帘后，首席执事正低声交代今晚压轴展柜的看守换班口令，茶几上放着紫檀主柜副匙。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回拍卖厅阶梯 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="velvet-q-5">
<<sneakicon>><<link "借侍者倒酒顺走副匙 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#velvet-q-5">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 270>>
	你借着端盘掩护将紫檀主柜副匙滑入袖袋，并将换班口令记了个一字不差。<span class="green">你取得了后台紫檀主柜副匙。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[潜入拍卖后台主柜 (0:05)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你的衣角碰响了茶几边缘的高脚水晶杯，首席执事冷冷挑开纱帘望过来。<span class="red">你在包厢外露出了破绽。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link "屏息贴在纱帘后记下口令 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#velvet-q-5">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 450 or ($english or 0) gte 260>>
	<span class="green">你取得了后台紫檀主柜副匙。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[潜入拍卖后台主柜 (0:05)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你在包厢外露出了破绽。</span><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Quest Velvet Mirage 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>>
拍卖后台内室里，紫檀主柜的铜锁已经插上副匙，门外走廊忽然响起两名执事急促的皮靴声，退路已被丝绒帏幔封住一半。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[趁执事未进门闪出侧廊 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="velvet-q-6">
<<sneakicon>><<link "屏息旋开主柜抽走底账 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#velvet-q-6">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 280>>
	你无声抽出暗层总账推开通风暗门，执事推门进来时只看见空荡荡的帷幔。<span class="green">你带着暗层总账顺利脱身。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺通风暗道撤往崖边 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	锁舌卡住半秒，两名执事已推门而入，银链与丝绒软鞭瞬间封死了你的去路。<span class="red">你在后台被执事当场截住。</span><<pain 3>><<stress 6>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<badendicon>><<link [[退向水晶展柜 (0:05)|MP BadEnd Velvet Doll]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link "撞翻烛台从侧窗跃出 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#velvet-q-6">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 270 or ($willpower or 0) gte 460>>
	<span class="green">你借烛火掩护带着底账突围。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺露台暗道撤离 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">突围失手，你落入了执事手中。</span><<pain 3>><<stress 6>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<badendicon>><<link [[被反剪双手押向展柜 (0:05)|MP BadEnd Velvet Doll]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Quest Velvet Mirage 7 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKeepsake to ($mpKeepsake or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpKeepsake["keepsake_velvet_mask"] to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_velvet_master_ledger"] to 1>>
你沿着峭壁内侧的隐秘石阶退回安全门廊。怀里的紫檀底账夹着一枚纯银狐面胸针与不记名筹码，将失踪舞者的去向与名流暗账记述得一清二楚。<span class="green">你彻底查明了天鹅绒暗层的幕后交易。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("quest_velvet_mirage_complete")>>
	<<money 1800>><span class="gold">你兑出了夹层里的 £18 不记名筹码。</span>
<</if>>
<<stress -6>><<trauma -2>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好银狐胸针返回门廊 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Observatory Wing 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
折光穹顶室的旋转滑轨槽里卡着半枚刻有校董会徽记的断齿铜轮，旁边留着新鲜的机油擦痕。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回天文翼楼门廊 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-q-1">
<<investigateicon>><<link "用铜镊夹出滑轨断齿轮 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#obs-q-1">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($maths or 0) gte 250>>
	你取出那枚断齿铜轮，发现背面刻着星图档案室一八九四年画筒的检索暗码。<span class="green">你找到了指向星图室的暗码。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去星图档案室查探 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	滑轨弹簧突然回弹夹痛了你的手指，沉闷声响在穹顶室里回荡。<span class="red">你被滑轨夹伤了手指。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<fisticon>><<link "扳动控制盘松开滑轨卡扣 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#obs-q-1">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	<span class="green">你找到了指向星图室的暗码。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去星图档案室查探 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你被滑轨夹伤了手指。</span><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Quest Observatory Wing 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
星图档案室顶层编号一八九四的黄铜画筒封盖半松，内壁似乎有一层可旋转的刻度暗套筒。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回星图档案室 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Star]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-q-2">
<<investigateicon>><<link "按铜轮暗码旋开内套筒 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#obs-q-2">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 250 or ($maths or 0) gte 260>>
	内套筒滑出一页泛黄的折光图纸，指明标本暗阁的萤石棱镜能映出密卷水印。<span class="green">你取出了百年折光图纸。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[转去标本陈列暗阁 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	樟木架顶层积灰簌簌落下迷了你的眼睛，你在木梯上晃了晃只得先下来。<span class="red">木梯摇晃令你无功而返。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link "用薄刀片挑开画筒底盖 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#obs-q-2">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	<span class="green">你取出了百年折光图纸。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[转去标本陈列暗阁 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">木梯摇晃令你无功而返。</span><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Quest Observatory Wing 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
标本陈列暗阁最里侧的紫水晶展柜下，一具双筒黄铜棱镜架被铜锁扣在实验桌凹槽里。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回标本陈列暗阁 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Cabinet]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-q-3">
<<sneakicon>><<link "用星盘小匙解开铜锁扣 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#obs-q-3">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 270 or ($science or 0) gte 260>>
	你顺利卸下双筒萤石棱镜，镜筒内侧刻着钟楼连廊测风铜筒的对焦角度。<span class="green">你拿到了萤石折光棱镜。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[登上屋顶钟楼连廊 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	展柜玻璃罩发出刺耳摩擦声，门外走廊传来了巡夜校工的脚步。<span class="red">声响惊动了外廊的巡夜人。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "拆卸实验桌底部的固定螺母 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#obs-q-3">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 440>>
	<span class="green">你拿到了萤石折光棱镜。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[登上屋顶钟楼连廊 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">声响惊动了外廊的巡夜人。</span><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Quest Observatory Wing 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
屋顶钟楼连廊的石砌飞扶壁外夜风猎猎，铜制风速计下方的密封铜筒正对着学园旧钟塔的百叶窗。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回屋顶钟楼连廊 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Bridge]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-q-4">
<<runicon>><<link "顶着夜风拧开测风铜筒 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#obs-q-4">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 270 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11600>>
	铜筒内滑出一枚十字配重铁匙，棱镜折射出的光斑正好落在赤道仪配重井盖上。<span class="green">你取得了赤道仪配重井铁匙。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回穹顶室配重井 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	屋顶狂风吹得你身形不稳，小腿磕在石栏排水兽角上。<span class="red">狂风过急，你只得退回连廊内侧。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "架起萤石棱镜校准钟塔刻度 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#obs-q-4">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 270 or ($maths or 0) gte 270>>
	<span class="green">你取得了赤道仪配重井铁匙。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回穹顶室配重井 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">狂风过急，你只得退回连廊内侧。</span><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Quest Observatory Wing 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
折光穹顶室中央赤道仪的配重井盖已被铁匙旋松，井底悬挂着一只铅封的校董会早年地产密卷匣。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回折光穹顶室 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-q-5">
<<sneakicon>><<link "顺着铁链探身取出密卷匣 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#obs-q-5">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280 or ($athletics or 0) gte 270>>
	你将铅封密卷匣稳稳提上井口，里面记载着旧学园与孤儿院早年土地侵占的铁证。<span class="green">你起出了铅封校董会密卷。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[应对逼近的脚步声 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	配重铁链发出哗啦轻响，连廊外突然亮起两束巡夜提灯的强光。<span class="red">铁链声引来了夜间看守。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "摇动赤道仪绞盘升起铁链 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#obs-q-5">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 270 or ($willpower or 0) gte 450>>
	<span class="green">你起出了铅封校董会密卷。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[应对逼近的脚步声 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">铁链声引来了夜间看守。</span><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Quest Observatory Wing 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
赤道仪配重井旁，你刚把铅封密卷收入怀中，旧翼楼走廊的铁栅门突然落下，巡夜守卫提着铜锁正朝穹顶室逼近。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[趁守卫未到退回翼楼门廊 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-q-6">
<<sneakicon>><<link "扳动天窗齿轮攀上连廊 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#obs-q-6">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 280 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>>
	你拨转赤道仪副轮打开折光天窗，顺着检修铁梯轻巧翻上屋顶连廊。<span class="green">你带着铅封密卷从天窗顺利脱身。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[沿屋顶连廊撤往安全处 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	天窗齿轮卡死，守卫已堵住正门，你匆忙退入隔壁旧档案室却听见门外咔哒落了铁锁。<span class="red">你被反锁进了旧档案室。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 6>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<badendicon>><<link [[退进旧档案室 (0:05)|MP BadEnd School Archive]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link "顺滑轨暗槽冲出侧廊 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#obs-q-6">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 280 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11800>>
	<span class="green">你凭敏捷身手抢先冲出了封锁。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[穿过暗门整理密卷 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你被困在了旧档案室里。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 6>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<badendicon>><<link [[躲进旧档案室 (0:05)|MP BadEnd School Archive]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Quest Observatory Wing 7 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKeepsake to ($mpKeepsake or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpKeepsake["keepsake_observatory_lens"] to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_observatory_board_secret"] to 1>>
你在图书馆古籍架后的暗门内停下喘息，撬开铅封密卷匣。里面不仅有早年校董会挪用孤儿院拨款的原始地契，还附着一枚镶金消色差目镜与封存经费。<span class="green">你完整揭开了旧天文翼楼封存的秘密。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("quest_observatory_wing_complete")>>
	<<money 1800>><span class="gold">你取得了密匣内封存的 £18 早期经费。</span>
<</if>>
<<stress -6>><<trauma -2>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好镶金目镜返回翼楼 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
